{"newText":"  // StreamTrace (diagnostic): FA_STREAM_TRACE=1 arms the per-chunk
  // net→emit→render timing trail at ~/.fah/logs/stream-trace.log — the
  // "streamed x ms, rendered y ms" post-mortem for bursty endpoints.
  // HOME resolves the log home on POSIX; streamTraceLogPath falls back
  // to USERPROFILE so Windows hosts (where HOME is unset) arm too.
  final traceLogPath = streamTraceLogPath(
    envLookup: (key) => Platform.environment[key],
  );
  if (traceLogPath != null) {
    maybeStartStreamTrace(
      File(traceLogPath),
